    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hungry Lily &amp; the Fallen Knight</strong> is a 2D pixel art platformer with a twist \u2014 you play as Lily, a scrappy little sausage dog tossed into a strange new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out weak and unsure, but grow stronger with each level as you unlock new powers, collect sprats (her favorite treat), and overcome increasingly challenging platforming trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll dodge enemies, land on moving platforms, and master tricky timed jumps. In the later dungeon levels (Level 9+), you\u2019ll gain special abilities and face tougher, corrupted enemies as Lily\u2019s journey deepens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a light story with mysterious characters, and more levels, powers, and secrets will be added during Early Access!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0By installing this game, you agree to the End User License Agreement (EULA), which is shown before installation.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hungry Lily &amp; the Fallen Knight</strong> is a 2D pixel art platformer with a twist \u2014 you play as Lily, a scrappy little sausage dog tossed into a strange new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start out weak and unsure, but grow stronger with each level as you unlock new powers, collect sprats (her favorite treat), and overcome increasingly challenging platforming trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll dodge enemies, land on moving platforms, and master tricky timed jumps. In the later dungeon levels (Level 9+), you\u2019ll gain special abilities and face tougher, corrupted enemies as Lily\u2019s journey deepens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a light story with mysterious characters, and more levels, powers, and secrets will be added during Early Access!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0By installing this game, you agree to the End User License Agreement (EULA), which is shown before installation.</p>",
    "short_description": "Hungry Lily &amp; the Fallen Knight is a platform 2D game with a twist. you start off as a weak sausage dog named Lily as she finds her way in a new world jumping platform to platform getting more stronger each level and having new powers. collecting sprats as her favourite treat. PLATFORM GAME.",
